  "preparation": "PREPBLD.PY stages the paired inputs from audio-adopt/SOURCE; AUDOLD substitutes direct MCIAPI.H and RAWAPP.H includes for the single LWAUDIO.H include. It copies audio-adopt/BUILD/BUILD30.BAT into each job and redirects TMP to the mounted D: drive. PREP.JSON records per-file input hashes.",
